  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_650bbfb825d040e38da63546821f0814",
      "statement": "ADR-0001 ratifies Komodo Variables (masked [[NAME]] variables interpolated into each stack's gitignored .env.prod at deploy time behind fail-fast ${VAR:?} compose references) as the single sanctioned production secrets mechanism for all core stacks, rather than adopting HashiCorp Vault as the backbone, because all seven production stacks already ran on Komodo Variables while Vault was deployed but never operationalized.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/decisions/ADR-0001-prod-secrets-management.md#L11-L22",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:aca61022fe6a3e3ec224b6e17d837ddefe6cca0c847890da85a1381280c14b88:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b4518cb4009e447da3116660a997e82d",
      "statement": "Vault was evaluated and explicitly rejected as the core-stack secrets backbone (not merely deferred by inertia): on a single-host, single-operator homelab its advantages (dynamic DB credentials, fine-grained audit, central rotation) are not pressing, while its concrete cost is that every host reboot brings Vault up sealed, silently blocking deploys until a manual unseal.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/decisions/ADR-0001-prod-secrets-management.md#L24-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6dd2f17b801f31af0a2cba6f8b446e5625407402112fa1eb8fc0bf0726836119:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e21ed81062ab4e56a1085008913f45fe",
      "statement": "A half-adopted Vault, where some secrets live in Vault and others in Komodo Variables, is explicitly rejected in ADR-0001 as worse than either pure option because it creates the exact dual-mechanism ambiguity the ADR forbids.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/decisions/ADR-0001-prod-secrets-management.md#L38-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:80ef362a4818b6bc1a5f7693d40b8ef54d9c9b83bcf9e056f2fec51b0aba3dd5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_078edd23d86b4784b6bd9c9afc2c08bd",
      "statement": "The Agent Gateway's Vault reader (agents/movie-assistant/src/secrets.py) reads at most one or two secrets from Vault only when VAULT_ADDR and VAULT_TOKEN are both set, falls back to the Komodo-injected environment on any Vault error or missing key without crashing, and is therefore inert in production today (where those env vars are unset) rather than a second source of truth.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agents/movie-assistant/src/secrets.py#L28-L68",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7e006387dbf0b76edfd791d53cc583a11e1816e1c370a5953eec39e7984be509:"
