        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_08abb6ebe7034c6e8966b543fb0a91d0",
      "statement": "prod-vault is the Komodo stack that declares no secret at all: it runs a real (non-dev) Vault on raft storage uninitialized and sealed with no root token in environment, and overrides its healthcheck status codes so Komodo reads the intentionally dormant server as healthy.",
