    {
      "id": "claim_8ad10ca139604a8bba36f7e92cda6ab0",
      "statement": "ADR-0001 is a ratification of the already-compliant status quo rather than an enhancement: it satisfies the \"environment variables\" leg of the constitution's Secrets Management principle (\"use environment variables or a dedicated secret management tool\"), keeping secrets out of source, config files and version control, whereas adopting Vault as the backbone would have been the enhancement.",
