    {
      "id": "claim_0f14661528e44ab1b1b75c26486cbd49",
      "statement": "Because ADR-0001 selected the Komodo-Variables option (B-opt-1), feature 026's US3 migration plan was never executed and no migration artifact exists; it would become the first deliverable of a follow-up Vault-adoption feature only if the §7 revisit trigger fires, and Workstream A shipped static SCRAM datastore credentials rather than waiting on Vault-issued dynamic ones.",
